{'symbol': 'BAC', 'date': '2022-05-23 07:00:00', 'title': 'BANK OF AMERICA ACCELERATES US MINIMUM HOURLY WAGE TO $22 AS NEXT STEP TO $25 BY 2025', 'text': "YEARLY MINIMUM RATE OF PAY FOR FULL-TIME EMPLOYEES WILL INCREASE TO MORE THAN $45,000 CHARLOTTE, N.C. , MAY 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY, BANK OF AMERICA ANNOUNCED IT HAS RAISED ITS U.S. MINIMUM HOURLY WAGE TO $22 AS A NEXT STEP IN THE COMPANY'S PLANS TO INCREASE TO $25 BY 2025."}